      "last": {
        "speaker": 2,
        "line": 1263,
        "text": "My dear, Larry has found what we all want and very fow of us ever get... I don't think anyone can fall to be better and nobler and kinder for knowing him...You see, my dear, good- ness is, after all, the greatest force in the world, and he's got it...."
      }
